repository-code: 'https://github.com/kristinebergs/calibrated-explanations-studies'
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility companion to the calibrated-explanations library.
  Authoritative home for evaluation code, datasets, notebooks, environment
  definitions, reproduction instructions, and result artifacts for published
  calibrated-explanations studies, covering binary
  classification, multiclass classification, regression, ensured explanations,
  guarded explanations, reject integration, conditional fairness, and
  performance benchmarking.
keywords:
  - Calibrated Explanations
  - Explainable AI
  - Reproducibility
  - Evaluation
  - Conformal Prediction
  - Venn-Abers
  - Feature Importance
